I'm running into this too, including on AssertionError, which is very problematic for test reporting.

I.e., this will also show the full stack trace
```
def bar():
    __tracebackhide__ = True
    raise ValueError

def assert_foo():
    __tracebackhide__ = True
    try:
        bar()
    except ValueError:
        assert False

def test_foo():
    assert_foo()

```
